---
import Policy from "../components/Policy.astro";
---

<Policy title="Cookie Policy" description="Rebound Lab does not set cookies or store anything in your browser.">
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We do not set cookies, and our analytics does not use cookies.</p>

  <h2>Other browser storage</h2>
  <p>
    Our own code does not use localStorage, sessionStorage or any other browser storage. A few pages run small scripts
    (for example, switching tabs on the board), and none of them save anything.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    Cloudflare Web Analytics counts page views without cookies. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for what
    Cloudflare processes.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever start using cookies, we will update this page and change the effective date above before they go live.</p>

  <Fragment slot="ko">
    <p>Rebound Lab은 쿠키를 설정하지 않으며, 방문 통계(Cloudflare Web Analytics)도 쿠키를 쓰지 않습니다.</p>
    <p>사이트 코드는 localStorage 등 브라우저 저장소도 쓰지 않습니다.</p>
    <p>쿠키를 쓰게 되면 적용 전에 이 페이지와 시행일을 먼저 바꿉니다.</p>
  </Fragment>
</Policy>
